	There are two ways to get your stuff disintegrated; either by
black dragon breath or by a spellcaster casting Disintegration on you.
Since it was a naga, I'll assume the latter.  To prevent this, you'd
need magic resistance, either through gray dragon scale mail (my
personal favorite), a cloak of magic resistance, or I think Magicbane
also gives magic resistance.  For black dragons and other monsters
that might breath disintegration, eating a black dragon corpse is
probably the best prevention.  Keep eating until you feel firm.

Disclaimer:  I haven't been playing v3.1 long enough to be sure that
some of these things haven't been changed.  They do work in v3.0,
